3. Competitive Problem Patterns
Task 3: Compare the Triplets – HackerRank
Approach
Compare corresponding elements of Alice and Bob.
import java.util.*;

public class Solution {

    public static List<Integer> compareTriplets(
            List<Integer> a,
            List<Integer> b) {

        int alice = 0;
        int bob = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {

            if (a.get(i) > b.get(i)) {
                alice++;
            } else if (a.get(i) < b.get(i)) {
                bob++;
            }
        }

        return Arrays.asList(alice, bob);
    }
}
Example
Alice = [5, 6, 7]
Bob   = [3, 6, 10]

Alice score = 1
Bob score   = 1
Output:
[1, 1]
Pattern: Direct comparison / counting.
