6. Task 6: Move Zeroes – LeetCode
Approach
Move all non-zero values to the beginning and put zeroes at the end.
class Solution {

    public void moveZeroes(int[] nums) {

        int index = 0;

        for (int num : nums) {

            if (num != 0) {
                nums[index] = num;
                index++;
            }
        }

        while (index < nums.length) {
            nums[index] = 0;
            index++;
        }
    }
}
Example
Input:
[0,1,0,3,12]

Output:
[1,3,12,0,0]
Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)
Pattern: Two-pointer / in-place processing.
